Race-car fastener inspection\nBattery and alternator test; repair cable: Loose master-switch connection; failing solder/crimp on alternator power cable repaired\nInstall window net: RaceQuip mesh window net\nRacing brake-fluid flush: Castrol SRF\nReplace radiator and flush cooling system: Mazda under cover; Red Line Water Wetter\nRace preparation and deferred maintenance","odometer_miles":6163,"vendor":"S Collective Service","cost":4065.32},{"source_id":"MNT-0007","vehicle":"Meat Ball","service_date":"2026-07-25","category":"Maintenance / Recall / Configuration","title":"Maintenance / Recall / Configuration — RO #1265013","description":"Disable enhanced engine audio / active noise control: Customer-requested in-cabin engine-audio configuration\nSeat-belt reminder chime request: Information-only line for front driver and passenger; no charge\nComplete safety recall 26TA02: Reprogram parking-assist ECU and calibrate camera; warranty/no charge\nOil and filter change with tire rotation: Toyota oil filter; 8 units GTMO 0W-20; multipoint inspection included\nMultipoint inspection, battery test and tire inspection: Tires inflated to factory-recommended PSI; no charge\nReplace six turbo-engine spark plugs: 6 Toyota spark plugs, part 90919-01295\nFull 4x4 fluid service: Front differential, rear differential and transfer case; 8090 gear oil and differential supplement\nBrake-system fluid exchange: DOT 4 brake fluid and non-chlorinated brake cleaner\nReplace both engine air filters: 2 Toyota air-filter elements, part 17801-YZZ17\nReplace cabin air filter: Toyota air-refiner element, part 87139-YZZA8\nFour-wheel alignment: Dealer four-wheel alignment service\nOCR verified from 5-page image-only invoice. Service invoice $1,642.55; card surcharge $49.28; total paid $1,691.83. Invoice includes $1,749.81 labor/parts, $79.95 shop charges, $220.00 discounts and $32.79 sales tax.","odometer_miles":55944,"vendor":"Toyota of Dallas","cost":1691.83},{"source_id":"MNT-0008","vehicle":"Snow Ball","service_date":"2025-07-07","category":"Inspection / Repair / Maintenance / Detailing","title":"Inspection / Repair / Maintenance / Detailing — RO #314","description":"Vehicle inspection: General inspection\nReplace rear trailing-arm bushings: 2 MOG rear suspension trailing-arm bushings; labor and tax included\nReplace front lower ball joints: 2 SNK front lower ball joints; labor and tax included\nReplace half-shaft seal: NOK CV joint half-shaft seal and NTN axle-shaft bearing; labor and tax included\nPower-steering fluid flush: IDE power-steering fluid, 12 oz; labor and tax included\nBrake and clutch fluid flush: ATE Type 200 DOT 4 brake fluid; labor and tax included\nReplace A/C, power-steering and alternator belts: Bando and Mitsuboshi drive belts; labor and tax included\nFour-wheel street alignment: Street alignment\nInterior and exterior detailing: Sublet detailing service\nPaid invoice; nine approved/authorized jobs logged from receipt","odometer_miles":166942,"vendor":"S Collective Service","cost":3714.15}]'::jsonb) as x(source_id text,vehicle text,service_date date,category text,title text,description text,odometer_miles integer,vendor text,cost numeric))
insert into public.maintenance_records(workspace_id,vehicle_id,service_date,category,title,description,odometer_miles,vendor,cost,source_url)
select w.id,v.id,s.service_date,s.category,s.title,s.description,s.odometer_miles,s.vendor,s.cost,'grid-import:'||s.source_id from src s cross join target w join public.vehicles v on v.workspace_id=w.id and v.name=s.vehicle
where not exists(select 1 from public.maintenance_records m where m.workspace_id=w.id and m.source_url='grid-import:'||s.source_id);
commit;
